@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Proposed recoverable set and independent protected copy
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Relational owned records\nGrants / history / references / pending effects" as DB
rectangle "Private artifact bytes\nPublished / preserved actual material" as F
rectangle "Native Git objects / refs\nActual repository storage context" as G
rectangle "Application / configuration provenance\nCompatible versions + tested rebuild recipe" as C
rectangle "Coordinated recovery-point manifest\nScope, versions, consistency and verification evidence" as M
rectangle "Independent protected copy\nEvaluated access / encryption / failure separation" as B
rectangle "Restricted recoverable key access\nSeparate lifecycle and actual usability" as K
rectangle "Isolated restoration evidence\nUsable workflows + current authority + external state" as R
DB --> M
F --> M
G --> M
C --> M
M --> B : capture / transfer / verify exact set
B --> R : restore chosen compatible point
K --> R : authorized usable key recovery
note bottom of R
 Backup destination and jobs are not configured.
 A file copy or successful exit is not proof of usable recovery.
 No schedule, retention or RPO/RTO is accepted here.
end note
@enduml
